        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.36,
            0.745,
            0.466
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You would observe that there is no appreciable change in the deflection of the needle when a sheet of any of the above material is placed between the magnet and the compass needle. Therefore, we can "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "conclude",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " that the magnetic effect can act through non-magnetic materials."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
